624
00:40:47.779 --> 00:40:49.990
kaya ayaw mong matalo.

625
00:40:50.073 --> 00:40:53.535
Kaya, malapit nang maging ang Rine Group
ang pinakamalaking conglomerate sa mundo.

626
00:40:54.244 --> 00:40:56.663
